Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not letting you in here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yugi, I hope you guys are\Ngetting close to finding Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only so long we'll\Nbe able to keep him, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,his thugs from getting in\Nhere and unplugging your pots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I knew guys could be dirty as pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't know they dressed the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you duel better than\Nyou smell, you swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I like about butterflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will clip her wings and\Nwin us the Niwatori prize card!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.11,0:01:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I got a girl for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've definitely seen her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, the Swordsman will take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigs don't know about trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Wall! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Wall reflects my swordsman's\Nstrike right back at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've seen this strategy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai always used that combo. Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My harpy lady really knows\Nhow to bring home the bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one duelist\Nthat could be this annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for the big finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Rose Whip Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Mokuba, I'm testing this\Ngame for some suits at Kaiba Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you could be in danger, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those suits\Nkidnapped my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's in a temple across the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They've trapped his mind\Nin this virtual game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And we need the Niwotori card to\Ncross the desert so we can rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the prize card for this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the fight! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed crown's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But they look really mad to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have a problem getting out\Nof here without finishing the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, even if we do escape, we still\Nwon't find Kaiba without that Niwatori card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not so sure about crossing\Na desert, but I'm over this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm positive that I\Ncan get that Niwatori card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady, use Rose Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.69,0:03:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Niwatori! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, we're in trouble now! Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta reach the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is much better than Duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowd control time! Go! Trap hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time they get around\Nthis, we'll be across the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to see if this card will\Nwork like the old man said it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you do the honors, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's giddy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,CSA and Kuiper Corp paid\Nyou to come here, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.73,0:04:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To make sure everything would go according\Nto plan when they used it on my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, they couldn't have\Nplanned on all of us. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's something worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another obstacle\Nprogrammed into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sandstone monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're never going to get past that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, I'll kick over the sand\Ncastle with my red eyes black dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Red eyes black dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferno Fire Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, through the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of ancient temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:04:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be what we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that where they're keeping Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,An old woman told us it was\Nthe temple across the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's gotta be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's gotta be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, drumsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys, Joey named his chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Niwutori, mate. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, here at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, or else we're gonna\Nlose both of them Kaiba brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This temple's seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's try and stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a labyrinth dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like where we doled them\Nweirdo Paradox Brothers, huh, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's locked tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:06:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally freaked. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that this is all\Na game and we'd never reach
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the end of this adventure\Nby going backwards anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means we gotta go through\Nthat maze to find Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that doofus will do\Nanything to meet a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he realizes I'm\Nway out of his league.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.91,0:06:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A labyrinth tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gaining on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Left, right, left, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta go now, Tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're\Ngetting by that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tanks coming from every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're boxed in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, anybody here got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, get past those\Ntanks. You got a plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise we're gonna have more\Nholes in us than Swiss cheese
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use my magical hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that trick You got us out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,just in time Now let's\Nmove this party Ouch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, that's my foot Sorry So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're in the clear Some\Nnice thinking there, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, those tanks are coming after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, another fairy, like we saw before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I bet it's one of them fairies that\Nthey put in games to help the players out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks like maybe\Nshe wants us to follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.09,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Think she can lead us to my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew, you're bound. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that fairy's\Nturned you into a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she make you smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They could be twins. Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We heard someone scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost Iru, my guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're all here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So can you get us out of this rat trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But Iru will find a way out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the end of the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're home free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say home free?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of anything that'll\Nbeat a monster that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.77,0:08:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He could crush us in one attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Kaiba Corp crooks must have put\NGate Guardian in the game to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can overcome anything\Nby working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll team up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll combine my red-eyes black\Ndragon with my summon skull and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,infuse them with a polymerization\Ncard to form the Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Great try, guys, but we still\Nneed even more attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's rigged against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I still got dragon nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It raises our attack power by 700 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten Fireball Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So much like the Heroes of Legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Heroes of legend? Oh,\Nmy lady! Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hannah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, we've been\Nworried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see you've made some\Nnew friends. They saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the bravest\Nwarriors I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As thanks, I'd like to invite\Nthem as guests to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're with me, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Witty Phantom, you took me\Nprisoner in my own game? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then release me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no longer your world to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your game's been reprogrammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late to the party, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I never liked parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least you will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.59,0:10:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you will have the great privilege of\Nbeing our offering to the Mythic Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Till then, your misery will be in\Nmy capable hands. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Override protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,End this simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your code's been rewritten,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and now all your silly safety\Nprecautions are a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now excuse me, there's so much to do\Nbefore the other offering is brought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Another offering?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you love the spotlight,\Nbut you'll just have to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I still don't know what to\Nmake of this crazy game world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but I like this part a\Nlot better than that maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.47,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I like Idina.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.01,0:10:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At least she knows how\Nto travel in high style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, you should be flattered that\NKaiba based such a cool character on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, on you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope they got food in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I just hope they can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Eru has taken a liking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.59,0:11:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the princess of this land,\NSimlao, Princess Adina. Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands and feet\Naway from Joey's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Adina, do you have\Nany news of my brother, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to say anything before,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but people often disappear when it\Nis time for the offerings. Offerings?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year at this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,offerings are collected\Nfrom this and another
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,kingdom so that the mythic\Ndragon can be resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the mythic dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.41,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The other kingdom has already\Nput up their offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Some stranger from a\Ndistant land. That's Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me where he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a dark castle floating in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A dark castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does that sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Castle of Dark Illusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That painting tells the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We have passed down the\Nlegend for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, a hero escaped that\Ndreaded castle on a flying machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said he hid his vessel\Nin Simlau a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His ship was never found, and there's\Nno other way to reach the dark castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We could fly there on Joey's dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic barrier protects the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.03,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No dual monsters can penetrate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:12:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep telling yourself\Nthis is only a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We can solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.27,0:13:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, life's a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do\Nabout your kingdom's offering?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry about my fate, for\Nwith the legend comes a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And it predicts that epic heroes will come
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to Simlao from beyond\Nthe distant mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It is these great heroes who, united,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.51,0:13:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,will create a power that is strong\Nenough to destroy the mythic dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you think that that's us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're the epic\Nheroes from the prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,On your shoulders rests\Nthe fate of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Joey is here to save the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Super dork's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't an eating contest, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go through that mythic\Ndragon to rescue Kaiba anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, there's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,To properly prepare you, we will adorn\Nyou in the manner of our greatest heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl like me could get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you make out, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I feel a bit silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you look just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Kaiba Corp's execs\Nhave reprogrammed this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.31,0:14:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be putting yourself in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, did you check me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I look way too good to be sitting at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Joey, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And back here is just where\NI'm staying, too. Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a wimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a bathroom rug, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But Joey, this is the traditional\Ngarb of our bravest national hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Something ain't right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a real bad\Nfeeling about this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, it's far too\Ndangerous for you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A castle floating in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle of dark illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all those duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they've come\Nto get their offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many\NDoommasters at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to stop them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The armed ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No way he's laying a hand on the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Witch, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Two down! This won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many to fight one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mai, summon back your Dark Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to use another strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Witch, return! Here's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll activate the Dark Hole Magic Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And then they'll be lost in its vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,On the tower, Yugi, the\Narmed ninja! Yeah, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That no-good armed ninja destroyed\Nyour Dark Hole Magic Card, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Use kunai with chain to attach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Whiptail Crow got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Adina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They've taken Mokuba. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's gone. Mokuba? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Adina? Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But we thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, they got Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch outfits with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go in your place\Nand join my brother Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so brave and I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.73,0:16:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one meant to\Nbe offered, not Okuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you must save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we reach the Dark Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, down there, ancient ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see, Yook?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have been\Nuncovered by the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That symbol of the\Nlegendary flying machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is where\Nyour ancient hero hid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if it's buried under\Nthere, it must be a fossil by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we ever restore it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's our only\Nhope of rescuing the Kaiba brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go down there and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yug, this is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way a plane\Nthat old is going to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to restore it to\Nthe way it was a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Restore it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, if the passage of time\Ncorroded the flying machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then turning back the clock\Nwill make it as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And what card can turn\Nback the clock, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you gave me before\NPegasus' tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The time wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It can make things like they\Nwere a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But if their hands land on skulls,\Nit'll take our life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto and Mokuba's future\Nhangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take these ruins back a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Time magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Time magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I think it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruins, they're rebuilding\Nthemselves. No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's rebuilding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you spoke too soon, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.27,0:19:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, we're in big trouble here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.53,0:19:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you might not be able\Nto come back at all.
